lyrics/agaph-einai.body.en:
Love is looking at the sky,
that in two eyes has completely fit
and fill the emptiness of your soul,
like no one else will ever be able to.

Love is a caress to the hair,
teasing you and always complaining,
to be lost in your every embrace
and fly, every time you look at me.

Give me a dance my heart tonight
and keep me strong only with you.
"What is love", quietly, sing to me;
tonight I became the man of your life.

Love is a coffee and a kiss;
a good night, which you will say in the dark;
an apology locked in a cell;
a forgiveness in every one of your flaws.

Love is waking up every morning;
staring at you sleeping every night;
to be resurrected by your fresh breath;
only your caress puts me to sleep.

Give me one dance, my heart, tonight...

Love is, to be honest,
a verse on smudged paper;
love songs, my eyes, you will find many,
but this one is dedicated to us.

